1 REM FBCS GFX-0013
2 REM CLAIM A-13.1.4-02
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 PRINT "GFX-0013 ASK DEVICE SIZE ASSIGNS THE NUMERIC AND THE STRING VARIABLE OF THE LIST (13.1.4)"
110 ASK DEVICE SIZE P, Q, U$
120 LET H = 99
130 LET W$ = "keep"
